[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0197","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0223","title":"Sam Hawker wmcdplay CD播放器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"wmcdplay 是一款运行于 WindowMaker 桌面环境的 CD 播放器程序，其 1.0 beta1-2 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该程序传递超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致内存数据被破坏，进而获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响 wmcdplay 1.0 beta1-2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前暂无官方补丁发布，建议用户避免使用存在漏洞的版本或限制本地用户对受影响程序的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0223"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Sam Hawker wmcdplay 1.0 beta1-2 及之前版本，官方已停止维护且不再发布补丁。建议立即卸载 wmcdplay 或切换至其他受支持的 CD 播放器（如 xmms、audacious）。如确需保留，执行 `chmod -s $(which wmcdplay)` 移除 setuid 权限位以限制提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0107.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1047","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19803","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0223.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0223","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0223.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0223.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hv7g-93g6-w87h/GHSA-hv7g-93g6-w87h.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0223.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2acf9df1-3dca-4547-9409-139a6e0c12c7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0161","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0183","title":"ircII 4.4 IRC客户端DCC Chat远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ircII 4.4及之前版本的IRC客户端在处理DCC Chat协议时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可以通过向目标用户发送特制的DCC Chat请求，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受害者系统上执行任意代码。攻击者需要诱使用户接受DCC Chat连接，攻击条件相对较高，但成功利用可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0183"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-03-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-03-10T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到修复此漏洞的 ircII 版本，Red Hat Linux 用户可参考 RHSA-2000-008 安全公告更新 ircII 软件包，其他发行版用户应联系厂商获取补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0093.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-008.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1046"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0152","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0152.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0173","title":"SCO UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 EELS 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1 及 7.1.1 EELS 子系统存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统服务崩溃或资源耗尽，影响系统可用性。该漏洞影响 SCO UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 版本，攻击复杂度低，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0173"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-03-10T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即应用 SCO 安全公告 SB-00.08a 中的 SSE 补丁包更新 EELS 组件。如无法获取官方补丁，应在网络边界防火墙限制对 UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 服务器的非信任来源访问，或迁移至仍受支持的操作系统以避免暴露于已知拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0173","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0173.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0173.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9wrc-pfwg-jgj4/GHSA-9wrc-pfwg-jgj4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88317/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0173.json","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--7aa0b3c1-34f8-4787-8ac9-c17e177d889b.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0152.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0555","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0175","title":"StarOffice StarScheduler 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"StarOffice StarScheduler 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送超长 GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 StarOffice 系列版本，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0175"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09Z","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 StarOffice 产品，迁移至活跃维护的开源办公套件 LibreOffice（最新稳定版）或 Apache OpenOffice，这些现代版本不再包含 StarScheduler Web 服务器组件。如无法立即迁移，应在系统层面关闭或卸载 StarScheduler 服务，并在防火墙上限制对 StarScheduler 端口（通常为 TCP 80）的入站访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0063.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1039","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0175","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0175/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0175.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0175.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r3c8-7qvw-hh92/GHSA-r3c8-7qvw-hh92.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0175.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001224.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cb2c32ba-c0e9-4331-a1f6-182d1e6bf9f8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0555.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0555.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0162","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0162.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0184","title":"Linux Printtool 打印机共享密码泄露漏洞","description":"Linux printtool 在创建打印机配置文件时未正确设置权限，所有配置文件被设为全局可读（world-readable），导致本地攻击者可直接读取配置文件中的打印机共享密码。该漏洞影响使用 printtool 的 Linux 系统，攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限即可利用，无需额外认证。成功利用后可获取打印机共享凭据并访问受保护的打印机资源。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0184"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10Z","remediation":"建议将打印机配置文件权限修改为仅 root 可读写（chmod 600 /etc/printcap 及 /var/spool/lpd 下相关配置文件），或升级到 CUPS 打印系统并限制 lpadmin 组仅包含可信用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0082.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1037","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0184.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0184","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0184.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0184.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x5cf-4wv5-4cg2/GHSA-x5cf-4wv5-4cg2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0184.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001225.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--16e4083f-da8a-4b13-b9b9-a2e0fdfde365.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--16e4083f-da8a-4b13-b9b9-a2e0fdfde365.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0162.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0153","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0153.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0174","title":"Sun StarOffice 5.1 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Sun StarOffice 5.1 的 StarScheduler Web 服务器组件存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞可导致服务器上的敏感文件（如配置文件、密码文件等）被未授权访问，影响运行 StarOffice 5.1 的系统。攻击者只需能够访问目标 Web 服务端口即可利用，攻击门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0174"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09Z","remediation":"升级到 Sun StarOffice 5.2 或更高版本，官方已在新版中修复了路径遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 StarOffice 配置中禁用 StarScheduler Web 服务器组件，或在防火墙层面限制对 8080 端口的访问。鉴于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache OpenOffice 或 LibreOffice 等活跃维护的开源办公套件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0063.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1040","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19797","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0174","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0174.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0174.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-28x7-82ww-2x5r/GHSA-28x7-82ww-2x5r.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0174.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2004-157.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c994d676-a809-44b9-a7c9-acf98cc03f02.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0609","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0202","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 及 MSDE 1.0 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 及 Microsoft Data Engine (MSDE) 1.0 存在权限提升漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标数据库发送特制的 SELECT 语句，利用 SQL 查询解析过程中的缺陷获取系统高级权限。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，攻击者成功利用后可执行任意代码、篡改数据或控制受影响系统。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0202"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-035 对应的 SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2 更新，或升级到更高版本。MSDE 1.0 用户应升级至 MSDE 2000 及以上受支持版本。由于 SQL Server 7.0 和 MSDE 1.0 已停止支持，建议迁移至当前受支持的 SQL Server 版本（如 SQL Server 2019/2022）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 1433 端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1041","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-014","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0202.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0202","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0202.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0202.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0202.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mssql_version.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0202.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001222.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0163","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0163.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0185","title":"RealNetworks RealServer 内部 IP 地址泄露漏洞","description":"RealMedia RealServer 5.0及7.0版本存在内部地址泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于服务器在响应特定请求时未能正确隐藏内网IP地址，导致即使服务器配置为仅返回公网地址，远程攻击者仍可通过发送特制请求获取目标服务器的真实内部IP地址。攻击者利用此信息可进一步探测内网拓扑结构，为后续攻击提供信息支撑。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0185"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10Z","remediation":"建议将 RealServer 升级至 8.0 或更高版本（已修复 IP 地址泄露问题）。如无法升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 RealServer 管理端口（默认 7070/9090）的访问来源，仅允许受信内网 IP 访问，同时禁用 RTSP 协议中的非必要信息回显功能，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0069.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1049","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19805","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0185.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0185","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0185.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0185.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9w74-573r-6pxq/GHSA-9w74-573r-6pxq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0185.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001221.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0201","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0225","title":"Pocsag POC32 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Pocsag POC32 程序存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可在未授权情况下直接访问其服务器端口，即使管理员已禁用该端口的访问选项。该漏洞源于程序未能正确限制远程用户对服务器端口的访问权限，导致原本应受限的服务暴露给外部网络，可能造成信息泄露或未授权操作。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0225"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15Z","remediation":"由于 POC32 软件已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新，建议立即在防火墙层面限制 POC32 服务端口的访问来源，仅允许受信任 IP 连接；如业务无需此服务，直接停用并关闭对应端口以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/259","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1032","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=003601bf854b%246893a090%240100a8c0%40FIREWALKER","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0225.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0225","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0225.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0225.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m9jw-qj52-57gm/GHSA-m9jw-qj52-57gm.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/poc32.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0225.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001220.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0201.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0177","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0177.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0200","title":"Microsoft Clip Art Gallery 5.0 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"微软 Clip Art Gallery 5.0（Microsoft Office 组件之一）处理 CIL（剪贴画库）文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制 CIL 文件并诱使用户打开，触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务或在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞利用需用户交互，影响安装了 Clip Art Gallery 的 Microsoft Office 系统，Microsoft 已通过安全公告 MS00-015 发布补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0200"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-015 提供的 Clip Art Gallery 补丁。访问 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyID=ed83e9c7-a80c-44b5-8ff5-f75d6bfdbd9b 下载并安装。如无法安装补丁，可禁用 Clip Art Gallery 对 CIL 文件的自动处理，并在浏览器和邮件客户端中设置不自动下载外部剪贴画内容以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1034","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-015","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19789","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0200","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0200.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0200.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-36fv-7fxv-xr4g/GHSA-36fv-7fxv-xr4g.json","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/greetings_cve.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0200.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--6f011b02-4ffb-49dc-a690-a90cf794e864.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0177.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0182","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0182.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0206","title":"Oracle Oracle8i 标准版 8.1.5 Linux 安装程序本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.1.5.x for Linux 安装程序在创建 orainstRoot.sh 文件时未正确处理符号链接，错误地跟随恶意符号链接并在全局可写权限下生成该文件。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞篡改安装脚本内容，在 Oracle 安装过程中获取 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Oracle8i Standard Edition 8.1.5 for Linux 版本，需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0206"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:13Z","remediation":"升级至 Oracle 8.1.6 或更高版本。安装前检查并清理 `/tmp` 及 Oracle 安装目录中的所有符号链接，确保安装路径不被攻击者控制。安装后立即执行 `chmod 755 $ORACLE_HOME/orainstRoot.sh` 收紧文件权限，并验证该文件所有者是否为 root。如无法升级，在安装脚本运行时以 root 身份监控文件系统变更，确保关键文件不被恶意覆盖。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0023.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1035","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19794","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0206.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0206","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0206.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0206.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqmj-xph7-4vqh/GHSA-mqmj-xph7-4vqh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0206.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001218.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f7db7bf9-0875-4ec1-85a6-5799142672ee.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0182.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0182.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0182.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0169","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0192","title":"Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 rpm_query CGI 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 默认安装中包含 CGI 程序 rpm_query，该程序未对访问来源进行有效身份验证和权限控制，导致远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 请求直接访问该 CGI 接口，获取系统已安装软件包的详细信息。此漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者无需任何认证即可利用，收集到的软件包信息可用于后续针对性攻击，影响 Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 所有默认安装版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0192"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11Z","remediation":"删除或移除非必要的 `/cgi-bin/rpm_query` CGI 脚本，或在 Apache 配置中限制对该脚本的访问（如仅允许本地 IP 访问）。建议升级到不再包含此 CGI 程序的 OpenLinux 后续版本，或迁移至受支持的 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0029.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1036","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19795","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0192.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0192","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0192.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0192.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fwxq-6xvp-vcv7/GHSA-fwxq-6xvp-vcv7.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rpm_query.nasl","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1179","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0169.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0169.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0169.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0148","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0148.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0168","title":"Microsoft Windows 设备名路径拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 9x 系列操作系统在处理文件路径名时未能正确过滤保留的设备名称（如 CON、NUL、LPT1 等），远程攻击者可向目标系统发送包含此类设备名称的特制路径请求，导致系统资源耗尽或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。此漏洞亦称 \"DOS Device in Path Name\"，影响 Windows 95/98/ME 及 Windows NT 3.5x/2000 等多个版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0168"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Windows 9x/NT/2000 等已停止支持的系统，建议立即升级到 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2016/2019/2022 等受支持版本。对于无法升级的遗留系统，应将其隔离到独立网络段，严格限制外部访问，并通过应用层过滤器拦截包含 DOS 设备名（如 CON、NUL、AUX）的路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1043","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2126","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=NCBBKFKDOLAGKIAPMILPCENECCAA.labs%40ussrback.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19799","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/75714a8ac899a2d78a02cc77946dc01b2cac6c38/2000/CVE-2000-0168.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0168","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/9c403f53c634b5fba65371b2388288bf1d7f551e/2000/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0168.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0168.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7ba068a8033bbcf6f889ad58dd7e0ad6c087aeb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vp56-995c-wxvc/GHSA-vp56-995c-wxvc.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0168.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/http_w98_devname_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/data/2000.json","https://github.com/adk86/CVE-Vulnerability-Research-Exploit-Analysis"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0148.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0148.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0181","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0181.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0205","title":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 远程拒绝服务攻击漏洞","description":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 存在远程拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过网络重放管理员命令，未经授权修改 OfficeScan 客户端的配置信息，导致服务异常或中断。该漏洞影响 OfficeScan 早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级中等。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0205"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:13Z","remediation":"立即安装 Trend Micro 官方提供的 OfficeScan 3.5 补丁（下载地址：http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm），修复管理命令重放问题。同时建议在防火墙层面限制对 OfficeScan 管理端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 地址连接，防止外部攻击者重放管理命令篡改客户端配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0015.html","http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1013","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=D129BBE1730AD2118A0300805FC1C2FE038AF28B%40209-76-212-10.trendmicro.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0205.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0205","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0205.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0205.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r295-x5cr-fmgr/GHSA-r295-x5cr-fmgr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0205.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001215.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d58100f5-bcd1-403d-9638-85556903467c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1013/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0181.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0181.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0181.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0151","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0151.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0172","title":"Matt Kimball mtr 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"mtr（My TraceRoute）网络诊断工具在权限降级处理中存在安全缺陷，仅调用 seteuid 而非 setuid 来降低权限，导致有效用户 ID 未被彻底重置。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞在权限降级后通过进程劫持或信号注入等方式重新获取 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 mtr 0.28/0.41 及 Turbolinux 3.5/4.2/4.4/6.0 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0172"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09Z","remediation":"立即将 mtr 升级至 0.42 或更高版本，该版本已将降权调用从 seteuid() 替换为 setuid()，确保永久丢弃 root 权限。Red Hat Linux/Turbolinux 用户请安装对应发行版安全更新。临时缓解措施：执行 chmod u-s /usr/sbin/mtr 移除 setuid 位（普通用户将无法使用 mtr，仅 root 可执行）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1038","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19796","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0172.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511ce